            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EA playful, holiday-style ode to the excitement surrounding the Umbraco v17 release, this poem follows a developer\u2019s sleepless anticipation as they await new features, celebrate major technical improvements\u2014from a redesigned back office to modernized front-end tooling\u2014and applaud the entire Umbraco community. Blending humor, gratitude, and tech enthusiasm, it captures the collective joy of Release Day.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://24days.in/umbraco-cms/2025/twas-the-night/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
